    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d236">

                <pb facs="0715" n="701" xml:id="pg701"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Preston, Secretary of the Navy, to Commodore Downes,
                        United States Navy.</hi>
                </head>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Navy Department</hi></placeName>,
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1849-08-21"><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >August</hi> 21, 1849</date>.</dateline>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The inclosed packet, addressed to Commander
                    Charles Lowndes, commanding the United States ship Germantown, you will be
                    pleased to have delivered to him with all practicable dispatch. His services
                    with the vessel under his command are required under confidential instructions;
                    you will therefore be pleased to facilitate his movements by affording every aid
                    in your power *to hasten his departure from Boston. <seg type="margin"
                        >[685]</seg></p>
                <p>I am, very respectfully, yours, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>WM. BALLARD PRESTON.</item>
                            <item>Commodore <hi rendition="#small-caps">John Downes</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Commandant United States Navy-Yard,
                                    Boston</hi>.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
